WEBVTT

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.380
The Witches, who once battled
the Neuroi in Britannia,

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:11.170
gathered, from across the globe,
for a new conflict in Europe.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:16.010
They re-established the
501st Joint Fighter Wing

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.890
and took to the skies once again,

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.100
in an attempt to repel the Neuroi.

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:06.580
The supplies you brought from Fuso are
an absolute lifesaver. Thank you.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.750
I read the report.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:12.300
Are its contents true?

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.300
Yes.

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:20.550
We thought we could
communicate with the Neuroi.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:30.560
But we weren't able to see eye to eye.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:34.570
They came back, more ferocious than ever.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.070
Be careful, Mio.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:45.750
Yeah. Next time we meet, Junko,
I'd like for the world to be at peace.

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:48.040
Me, too.

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.210
We're heading back, Miyafuji.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.800
Oh, okay.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:58.590
They were able to
communicate with the Neuroi?

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:02.850
They tried, but they failed.

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:06.720
Right before they were
about to initiate contact,

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.520
a new Neuroi appeared and completely
destroyed the humanoid Neuroi.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:12.440
Huh? A Neuroi destroyed another Neuroi?

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.730
Why would it do that?

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.190
I don't know.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:18.990
What I do know is that only Captain Takei,

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:23.200
along with a handful of others,
survived the onslaught.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.450
The 504th Aerial is currently reorganizing,

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:30.290
but recruiting Witches will take some time.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:32.670
All the while, the Neuroi
push farther south,

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.040
from Venezia into Romagna.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.960
The ground forces are holding them back,

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:41.090
but when the Neuroi
decide to attack for real,

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:44.890
it'll be up to us Strike Witches to fend them off.

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:47.680
Sakamoto-san, I will fight, too!

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.270
I will fight and defend Romagna!

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:52.730
All right! That's the spirit, Miyafuji!

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.770
Let's hurry back and begin training.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:55.690
Huh?

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:57.020
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.330
They're painfully out of shape.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:19.170
Those three have been inactive
since the Battle of Britannia.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:21.590
It's been over six months since
they've seen active duty.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.510
And those three had nothing but issues

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:26.890
during morning flight training, too.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:37.060
Major, as it stands, it's too
dangerous to send them into battle.

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.110
You're right.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.440
Get up, you two.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:43.900
Sakamoto-san.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.410
Major!

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:49.830
Miyafuji, Lynne, Perrine...

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:51.830
You're going to retrain from scratch!

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:54.250
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:02.630
That's it, over there.

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:09.220
Is this really where we'll be training?

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:13.350
It's the place marked on the
map the Major gave us.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:16.020
But there's no one here.

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:18.230
Yoshika-chan, look up.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:23.610
A Neuroi!

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:25.610
Who're you calling a Neuroi?

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:27.240
It spoke!

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:31.240
Sneaking onto my property,
not even introducing yourselves...

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:34.500
Young people these days have no manners!

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:36.830
N-Nice to meet you.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:39.590
Might you be Anna Ferrara-san?

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:40.130
Huh?

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:42.380
Of course I am.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:46.590
Excuse us. We came here to train,
per Major Sakamoto's orders.

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:50.600
She said we can't return until we pass!

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.600
Start by taking off those
things on your legs.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.230
Buckets?

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:06.400
First, I need you to bring me
water for supper and baths.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.740
Bring water?

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.740
Um...

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.620
The well's over there.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:15.660
Huh? But it's so far...

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:21.090
We're an island in the sea.
That's the only location with fresh water.

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:23.750
Oh! Well, if we put on our Strikers...

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:24.510
Yeah!

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:29.390
Good idea. With our Strikers on, it won't take long at all.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:34.220
Who said you could use those things?

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:35.020
Huh?

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:38.520
Here. Use these.

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.060
You don't mean...

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.360
Brooms?

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.280
Away we go!

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.170
I-It hurts...

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.050
It's riding up between my legs...

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:10.720
It's...

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:23.520
You guys gonna stay on the ground all day?

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:27.230
Get flying, or you won't
make it in time for supper!

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:37.660
Just pathetic! And you call yourselves witches...

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:42.880
Your balance is off due to the
extra weight you're carrying.

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:47.500
How long are you gonna sit there, spinning?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.760
A-Ask the broom!

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:59.310
Oh, you're not bad.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:04.230
Th-This is nothing for a Witch!

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:08.730
It's... It's... It's a piece of cake...

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:10.860
A piece of cake, eh?

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:18.450
I-I-It's rubbing between my legs!

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:25.170
I don't think you three will ever pass.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.090
N-No!

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:30.420
Nowadays, Witches never use brooms!

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:33.720
There's a limit to how far
back in time you can go!

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.640
I refuse to do this!

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:39.180
Oh? Throwing in the towel already, are we?

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:40.350
Perrine-san.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:41.390
Anna-san!

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:42.100
Huh?

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:43.350
Excuse me...

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:45.230
I want to know!

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:48.230
Will training like this
really make us stronger?

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:51.610
Do you wish to be stronger?

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:52.530
Yes!

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:53.610
Why?

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:58.240
I want to be strong and protect
the world from the Neuroi!

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:01.080
I want to save those in trouble.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.080
Yoshika-chan.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:08.840
Observe.

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:18.220
Anna-san?

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:20.390
She left...

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:26.440
Hmph! I hope she doesn't come back.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.190
Ah! She's back.

00:09:28.190 --> 00:09:28.770
Huh?

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:40.870
You carried all that?

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:43.000
B-By yourself?

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:43.950
That's amazing!

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:48.130
But... Will we really get stronger doing this?

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:49.960
You don't believe me?

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:54.170
What if I told you that your
instructor once trained here

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.380
before becoming a real witch?

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:58.340
Huh? Our instructor?

00:09:58.340 --> 00:09:59.720
Major Sakamoto?!

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:03.100
Yes! And she was such an obedient girl...

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:08.810
Right from the start, she respected me and trained her butt off.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:13.320
And by doing so, she grew
into a top-notch witch!

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:15.530
Wow...

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:17.740
So Sakamoto-san went
through this training, too!

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:19.110
U-Um...

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:24.040
Wh-Which broom did Major
Sakamoto use, exactly?

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.250
The one you just tossed away.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.830
Oh! That was hers?!

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:29.920
Ah! Oh, my! Oh, dear...

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:35.510
Ah, this is the broom she used...

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:36.840
The hell?

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:55.860
I wanted to take a bath...

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:03.580
Huh?

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:06.410
O-Old hag?

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:10.040
That's Sakamoto-san's handwriting.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.040
Okay.

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:44.490
It's... It's...

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:47.540
It's rubbing between my legs!

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.080
Sheesh.

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.670
Come here, you three.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:56.000
You each have more than
enough magic power to do this.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.960
What you lack is control.

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:01.260
You need to start controlling
your own movements, in place of

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.260
the machines you've relied on.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:09.930
Th-That hurts, Anna-san!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:13.310
It hurts because all your weight
is pushing on the broom!

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.520
You, too!

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:17.270
And you, as well!

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:26.700
Listen up. You have become completely
reliant on those Striker Unit things.

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:30.290
You must unlearn that reliance and
become one with the broom.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.370
One with the broom?

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:37.710
You're not <i>riding</i> the broom.
It should feel like an extension of your body!

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.250
An extension of my body...

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:42.840
Then, while picturing that,
take one step forward

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:45.550
and focus your magic.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:49.560
It should be trivial for a real witch to do.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.480
One step...

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:02.490
...forward.

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:10.620
I-I'm flying!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.540
Me, too!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.330
I-I'm flying!

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:25.130
This is amazing!

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.680
Just amazing, Lynne-chan, Perrine-san!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.640
We're flying on brooms!

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:30.350
Yeah!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:32.180
N-Naturally.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:37.980
The breeze feels different than
when we fly the Striker Units.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:39.650
It feels so good!

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:42.030
Yeah, it sure does.

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:46.070
B-But it's still rubbing... a little...

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:48.870
How long you gonna just hover there?

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:49.910
Huh?

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:53.080
Hurry and get the water,
before the sun sets!

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:55.830
W-We were just going!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.830
Be right back!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:09.760
Okay, that's probably
enough for today.

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:10.680
All right!

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:11.850
Great work.

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:15.020
But of course. This was
hardly any trouble at all.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:21.770
Thanks for supper!

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:33.490
It's so good!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.080
Just eat and take your baths!

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.170
It's like bathing in a puddle.

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:48.180
We didn't fetch enough water.

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:52.010
Oh... We'll have to keep at it
tomorrow, until it's filled.

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.220
Yeah.

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:54.890
Huh?

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.140
Perrine-san, aren't you joining us?

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:57.770
Huh?

00:14:57.770 --> 00:15:00.190
O-Of course I am.

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.950
I-It stings down there!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.660
Y-You scared me.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:15.240
Are you all right, Perrine-san?

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.250
This breeze feels so nice.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.250
Yeah.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:27.340
It's crazy to think that all
Witches once flew on brooms,

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:29.380
before Striker Units were invented.

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:33.010
My mom said she used one, too.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:38.020
But will merely flying on brooms
truly make us stronger?

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:40.640
You three have no confidence in me.

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:42.350
A-Anna-san.

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:46.440
I told you we're starting early tomorrow.
What are you doing up here?

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:47.980
We were checking out this bridge.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.860
This bridge? What about it?

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:56.120
Well, I was thinking that you
probably don't need it,

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:59.000
given that you're an expert flyer.

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:05.750
My daughter can't use magic.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:06.550
Huh?

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:07.630
Your daughter?

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:10.720
Many years ago, she got
married and moved away,

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:14.510
but a few times a year,
she still visits with the grandkids.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:16.810
And she uses this bridge to get here.

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:20.140
Where does your daughter live?

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:21.390
Venezia.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:22.520
Venezia!

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:24.480
The Neuroi invaded them.

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:31.240
They're fine. I got word that
the whole family escaped unscathed.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.950
They're on their way here, as we speak.

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:38.160
I hope they arrive soon.

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:38.990
Me, too.

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:39.910
Agreed.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:42.750
Just hurry and get off to bed!

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:45.000
Training starts again
tomorrow, bright and early!

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:57.010
We should have carried it
like this from the start.

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:58.760
Y-Yeah.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:01.430
Today, let's fill the bath all the way up.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:04.100
Yeah, all the way to our shoulders.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.810
Right, Perrine-san?

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:10.190
Huh? I'm fine either way.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:16.160
What is that?

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.070
It couldn't be...

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:17.990
A Neuroi!

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:22.830
According to the observation post's report,

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.790
they're making a beeline, from
their original location in Venezia,

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:28.960
along the Adriatic Coast, into Bari.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:32.380
These Neuroi only travel in straight lines.

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:38.760
We'll intercept them over water.

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:42.180
They only just graze land, along the way.

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.810
Looks like they won't land at shore.

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:47.650
Then we can avoid an
emergency deployment.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:48.730
Wait!

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:50.770
That's...

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:51.780
This is bad!

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:55.650
Anna-san, help!
The Neuroi are coming this way!

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:58.950
Your base just contacted me.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:01.200
Are they sending someone here to fight it?

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:06.960
They said any troops deployed
now wouldn't make it in time.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:10.960
I'll have to abandon this house.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.300
No way.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.640
It's heading straight in this direction.

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:21.560
Then both the island and the bridge...

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:23.430
...will be entirely destroyed.

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:27.520
What are you girls doing?
Hurry and escape!

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:29.520
We can't just leave while
this place gets destroyed!

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:32.020
This is the house your
family's coming home to.

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:36.190
Also, if the bridge is taken out,

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:40.280
when they arrive, your grandchildren
won't know what to look for.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:43.030
G-Girls...

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:45.500
Taking off!

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:55.300
Lynne-san and I will attack in formation.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.920
Cover us, Miyafuji-san.

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:57.970
Roger!

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:08.230
Commencing attack!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.700
Its armor is hard!

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.040
To cause any real damage,
we'll need more firepower.

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:29.250
Let's all attack it together.

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:32.920
But a three-person attack
formation is really advanced.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:33.960
We can do it!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.760
The three of us can definitely do it.

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:39.050
Then let's move in.

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:40.090
Okay!

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:55.570
I can follow all your moves.

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.280
We're dodging the beams!

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:58.940
It's all thanks to the brooms.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.360
The core is exposed!

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:04.870
It's already regenerating.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:06.660
We need to destroy the core now!

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:07.990
I'll do it!

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:12.370
Too late!

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.710
Watch out, Lynne-chan!

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:20.420
Lynne-chan!

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:22.260
Yoshika-chan!

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:31.480
You're flying together!

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:36.150
My shield will get us in close.
Lynne-chan, aim for the core!

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:37.230
Roger that!

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:39.230
It's almost reached the island!

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:41.990
Hurry! I'll cover you.

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.540
Now's your chance!

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:56.580
Lynne-chan!

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:57.590
Got it!

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:08.510
We did it!

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:11.430
You did it!
You did it, Lynne-chan!

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:15.100
Yeah! We were able to defend
Anna-san's home and bridge.

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:29.490
You all pass.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:37.380
It's Sakamoto. Thank you
for taking care of them.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:40.590
Oh, there weren't any problems at all.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:44.800
Unlike someone, they
didn't stay in bed and cry.

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:51.350
Hey! Wait up!

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:52.560
<i>Old hag.</i>

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:53.180
Wait!

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:54.270
I didn't cry!

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:55.480
Hey! Slow down!

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:59.270
Pipe down! Grandma's trying
to talk on the phone!

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:03.190
Anyway, about the girls...

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:04.360
Yes?

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.780
I have high hopes for those three.

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:10.830
As do I.

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:13.910
Hey! Get your feet off the table!

00:24:12.530 --> 00:24:13.820
Behold, Liberion.

00:24:13.820 --> 00:24:15.740
Witness Karlsland's ultimate weapon!

00:24:15.740 --> 00:24:17.120
The Neuroi don't stand a chance!

00:24:17.120 --> 00:24:18.160
Shouldn't you be keeping that secret?

00:24:18.160 --> 00:24:19.330
Stop!

00:24:19.330 --> 00:24:25.000
Next time on <i>Strike Witches 2:</i>
Harder, Faster, Greater!
